> One unit in → professor enrichment consumed → student lesson + **Reveal slideshow** (≤ 6 main ideas) + studio/exercise artefacts.
> Pattern sibling: `digital-creativity-uem/digital-creativity-pedagogy/dc-unit-forge.mdc`.
> Studio skill: `~/src/.cursor/skills/curriculum-forger` + `references/institution-ct.md`.

## 0. Hard prerequisites (fail closed)

1. [`SESSION-RHYTHM-AND-DELIVERABLES.mdc`](./SESSION-RHYTHM-AND-DELIVERABLES.mdc) — Masterclass → Lab → Workshop; D1–D5; geometrical `lab_opener` / `workshop_opener` / `outro`.  
2. [`UNIT-THEME-ENRICHMENT.mdc`](./UNIT-THEME-ENRICHMENT.mdc) pack for this unit is complete (`PROFESSOR.md` + `MAIN-IDEAS.yml`) — board: [`unit-enrichment/INDEX.md`](./unit-enrichment/INDEX.md).  
3. Grounding synthesis read: [`../grounding/COMBINE-RELATE-DISCUSS.md`](../grounding/COMBINE-RELATE-DISCUSS.md) + [`../grounding/pass1.edited.md`](../grounding/pass1.edited.md) + unit row in [`../grounding/EVIDENCE-MATRIX.md`](../grounding/EVIDENCE-MATRIX.md).  
4. [`DISCURSIVE-CIRCULATION-FORGE.mdc`](./DISCURSIVE-CIRCULATION-FORGE.mdc) — **critical review trans-unit** (D2) **and** the transversal CV critical layer (C1–C3). Every unit names lenguaje/medio/soporte + one circulation moment **and** at least one C1/C2/C3 hook in professor brief or Analysis method. Fail closed if missing — see that forge’s “Transversal critical layer” table. Priority D2 coats: Steimberg 2013 *Semióticas…transposición*; Werhane & Bevan 2026 *Moral Imagination*; Munari *The Circle* + manifesto anthology (quote after Ahmes).  
5. [`STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE.mdc`](./STUDENT-SLIDESHOW-FORGE.mdc) spine respected (≤ 6 Masterclass ideas + mandatory Lab/Workshop frame slides).  
6. Official contract: guía JSON — **150 h** presencial; contact-forgeable **80 h**; evaluation **60/40**.  
7. Discover in vectors · **cite Ahmes nodes only** (or honest `chicago: null` for pilot).

Do **not** invent CONTENIDOS. Critical layers **C1–C3** (ideology; labour; GenAI authorship) are pedagogy-only **and mandatory as a transversal CV layer** — they never become fake CONTENIDOS IDs, but a forged unit that omits them is incomplete. Student **Methods** stays practice-oriented.

