- Track Units table **must** list both `[lesson](…)` · `[deck](…)` in the Status cell for that unit (same permalinks)
- Required **`lab_opener`** (geometrical) before portfolio-bound exercises
- Required **`workshop_opener`** + **`outro`** (geometrical)
