## 5. Honest stop

If enrichment is incomplete, **stop**. Do not forge a decorative lesson from vector snippets alone. Same rule applies to `lesson-scribe`: if any of (a)/(b)/(c) above is empty or `chicago: null` beyond acceptable pilot status, the forger emits the lesson with an explicit **hypothesis** framing (as U1 already does for its "studio stance" ideas 4/5/6) rather than manufactured citations.

